  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper introduces CircuitHunt, an automated screening pipeline that selects parameterized quantum circuits from the KetGPT dataset for a hybrid QNN fraud detector. The selected 6‑qubit circuit with 9 trainable parameters achieves 97% test accuracy and ROC‑AUC 0.9946 on the Kaggle credit‑card fraud dataset (20,000 balanced samples). Removing the residual skip connection drops performance substantially, reducing AUC to 0.7706 and class accuracy to ~0.70.",
  "experiments": [
